From: Harvi654 <202698022+Harvi654@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] msi: Keep already Local selections and advertised children.

AI-assisted (Codex), original code; LGPL-2.1-or-later.

Windows v14 props/post level-parent: repeating Local on an already Local
feature does not select its optional children. Keep the existing Local
request unchanged; source/advertised descendants are boundaries when a new
level-mode explicit target propagates Local. Preserve the measured v10 all-
children behavior for unselected optional FP/non-FP descendants.

Shared v14 props/post level-parent and stable controls assert immediate Get
and publish; RULE_REPEAT. Frozen B/D patch artifacts are not edited.

--- a/dlls/msi/install.c
+++ b/dlls/msi/install.c
@@ -939,6 +939,8 @@
     WCHAR *addlocal;
     BOOL explicit_selection;
 
+    if (target->ActionRequest == INSTALLSTATE_LOCAL) return ERROR_SUCCESS;
+
     nodes = calloc( count, sizeof(*nodes) );
     queue = malloc( count * sizeof(*queue) );
     if (!nodes || !queue) { free( nodes ); free( queue ); return ERROR_OUTOFMEMORY; }
@@ -979,7 +981,8 @@
         LIST_FOR_EACH_ENTRY( child, &node->feature->Children, FeatureList, entry )
         {
             struct feature_selection_node *next = &nodes[child->feature->selection_index];
-            if (next->visited || next->feature->Level <= 0 || next->feature->disabled_at_load) continue;
+            if (next->visited || next->feature->Level <= 0 || next->feature->disabled_at_load || next->feature->ActionRequest == INSTALLSTATE_SOURCE ||
+                next->feature->ActionRequest == INSTALLSTATE_ADVERTISED) continue;
             next->visited = TRUE;
             queue[tail++] = next;
         }
